From 38ff42202fd0ee74def858065b2bf504509e1059 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ruben van der Linde <ruben@conduction.nl>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:12:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(opencatalogi): build
 opencatalogi-delegate-broadcast-to-or-webhooks [skip ci]

Tasks 1-3: enqueueBroadcast() hands each broadcast to OpenRegister's
WebhookService::triggerWebhookForEvent() through one shared per-target
webhook for opencatalogi.federation.broadcast, created on first use and
idempotent under a lost race, and answers `enqueued`. Without per-target
delivery on OpenRegister it logs a deprecation and the legacy loop delivers.

Assisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5
